  user_input {
    user_response: "Buatkan aplikasi web \"Hotel Management System (HMS) & Channel Manager\" modern dan responsif untuk mengelola 1 properti (Single Property - 15 Kamar). 5 DELUXE ROOMS, 5 STANDARD AC, 5 ROOM EKONOMI KIPAS, Gunakan desain UI/UX SaaS profesional dengan navigasi sidebar.\n\nFitur utama yang wajib dibuat:\n\n1. AKSES LOGIN & ROLE SWITCHER (OWNER, ADMIN, RESEPSIONIS)\nSediakan fitur Role Switcher di header untuk simulasi pindah akses secara instan:\n- OWNER: Akses penuh ke Executive Dashboard, Grafik Performa, dan Laporan Keuangan Bulanan Otomatis (Profit & Loss).\n- ADMIN: Akses penuh ke pengaturan Rate Plan, persentase komisi OTA, input Biaya Operasional, dan Laporan Keuangan.\n- STAF RESEPSIONIS: Hanya bisa mengakses Kalender Kamar, Check-in/Check-out, Input Reservasi Baru, dan Status Housekeeping (Available, Occupied, Dirty, Maintenance). Menu Laporan Keuangan dan Biaya Operasional disembunyikan untuk role ini.\n\n2. STRUKTUR KAMAR & RATE PLAN\nBuat 3 tipe kamar (Total 15 unit) dengan skema harga Weekday & Weekend:\n- Standard Room (8 unit): Weekday Rp 300.000 | Weekend Rp 350.000 (Room Only)\n- Deluxe Room (5 unit): Weekday Rp 450.000 | Weekend Rp 525.000 (Include Breakfast)\n- Family Suite (2 unit): All Day Rp 750.000 (Include Breakfast)\n\n3. INTEGRASI OTA & PERHITUNGAN KOMISI OTOMATIS\nHubungkan pencatatan reservasi dan ketersediaan kamar dengan 6 sumber booking beserta potongan komisinya:\n- Direct Booking / Walk-in (Komisi 0%)\n- Airbnb (Komisi 14%)\n- Traveloka (Komisi 15%)\n- Tiket.com (Komisi 15%)\n- Agoda (Komisi 17%)\n- Booking.com (Komisi 18%)\nSaat reservasi diinput atau masuk dari OTA, sistem otomatis menghitung: Gross Revenue (Harga x Malam), Potongan Komisi OTA, dan Net Room Revenue (Pendapatan Bersih Kamar). Sertakan tombol \"Sync OTA Availability\" dengan indikator status terkoneksi.\n\n4. MODUL BIAYA OPERASIONAL (EXPENSE TRACKER)\nHalaman untuk Admin menginput pengeluaran bulanan dengan kategori:\n1. Gaji Staf & Operasional SDM\n2. Listrik, Air, WiFi & Gas (Utilities)\n3. Housekeeping, Laundry & Amenities\n4. Bahan Baku Sarapan (F&B Cost)\n5. Maintenance & Perbaikan Rutin\n6. Marketing & Promosi\n7. Depresiasi Aset & Peralatan\n\n5. TABEL LAPORAN KEUANGAN BULANAN OTOMATIS (PROFIT & LOSS STATEMENT)\nBuat halaman Laporan Keuangan Bulanan dengan filter Bulan & Tahun yang menampilkan tabel akuntansi terstruktur:\n- Bagian A (Pendapatan per Channel): Menampilkan baris untuk Direct Booking, Traveloka, Tiket.com, Agoda, Booking.com, dan Airbnb dengan kolom: Jumlah Malam Terjual (Room Nights), Gross Revenue, Komisi (%), Nominal Potongan Komisi, dan Net Room Revenue.\n- Bagian B (Rincian Biaya Operasional): Menampilkan total pengeluaran per kategori biaya termasuk Depresiasi Aset.\n- Bagian C (Ringkasan Akhir): Menampilkan Total Gross Revenue, Total Potongan Komisi OTA, Total Net Room Revenue, Total Biaya Operasional, serta NET PROFIT AKHIR (Net Room Revenue dikurangi Biaya Operasional) lengkap dengan persentase Net Profit Margin dan metrik Occupancy Rate (%).\n- Sertakan grafik perbandingan pendapatan OTA dan tombol \"Export PDF / CSV\".\n\nIsi aplikasi dengan data dummy realistis bulan berjalan agar seluruh tabel, status kamar, dan laporan keuangan langsung terisi angka lengkap saat aplikasi pertama kali dibuka.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nMedia attachment: User sent attachment: /assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.47.33__1__ff787f88.jpeg (saved in workspace at /public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.47.33__1__ff787f88.jpeg). Read it with view_file at that path; in shell commands, which run from the workspace root, use the relative path public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.47.33__1__ff787f88.jpeg. When displaying or embedding this asset in code, reference this local file path directly. Only invoke image generation tools if the user explicitly requests creating or modifying an image.\n  User sent attachment: /assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.19__1__a60790da.jpeg (saved in workspace at /public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.19__1__a60790da.jpeg). Read it with view_file at that path; in shell commands, which run from the workspace root, use the relative path public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.19__1__a60790da.jpeg. When displaying or embedding this asset in code, reference this local file path directly. Only invoke image generation tools if the user explicitly requests creating or modifying an image.\n  User sent attachment: /assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.20__1__ee56a5e9.jpeg (saved in workspace at /public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.20__1__ee56a5e9.jpeg). Read it with view_file at that path; in shell commands, which run from the workspace root, use the relative path public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.20__1__ee56a5e9.jpeg. When displaying or embedding this asset in code, reference this local file path directly. Only invoke image generation tools if the user explicitly requests creating or modifying an image.\n  User sent attachment: /assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.47.34_ffdaa2b7.jpeg (saved in workspace at /public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.47.34_ffdaa2b7.jpeg). Read it with view_file at that path; in shell commands, which run from the workspace root, use the relative path public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.47.34_ffdaa2b7.jpeg. When displaying or embedding this asset in code, reference this local file path directly. Only invoke image generation tools if the user explicitly requests creating or modifying an image.\n  User sent attachment: /assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.19__2__a2226d35.jpeg (saved in workspace at /public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.19__2__a2226d35.jpeg). Read it with view_file at that path; in shell commands, which run from the workspace root, use the relative path public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.19__2__a2226d35.jpeg. When displaying or embedding this asset in code, reference this local file path directly. Only invoke image generation tools if the user explicitly requests creating or modifying an image.\n  User sent attachment: /assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.20_310de5fb.jpeg (saved in workspace at /public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.20_310de5fb.jpeg). Read it with view_file at that path; in shell commands, which run from the workspace root, use the relative path public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.20_310de5fb.jpeg. When displaying or embedding this asset in code, reference this local file path directly. Only invoke image generation tools if the user explicitly requests creating or modifying an image.\n  User sent attachment: /assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.20__2__d49d62d9.jpeg (saved in workspace at /public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.20__2__d49d62d9.jpeg). Read it with view_file at that path; in shell commands, which run from the workspace root, use the relative path public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.20__2__d49d62d9.jpeg. When displaying or embedding this asset in code, reference this local file path directly. Only invoke image generation tools if the user explicitly requests creating or modifying an image.\n  User sent attachment: /assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.47.34__1__975e8edf.jpeg (saved in workspace at /public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.47.34__1__975e8edf.jpeg). Read it with view_file at that path; in shell commands, which run from the workspace root, use the relative path public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.47.34__1__975e8edf.jpeg. When displaying or embedding this asset in code, reference this local file path directly. Only invoke image generation tools if the user explicitly requests creating or modifying an image.\n  User sent attachment: /assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.21_f037660f.jpeg (saved in workspace at /public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.21_f037660f.jpeg). Read it with view_file at that path; in shell commands, which run from the workspace root, use the relative path public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.21_f037660f.jpeg. When displaying or embedding this asset in code, reference this local file path directly. Only invoke image generation tools if the user explicitly requests creating or modifying an image.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Add database and auth\"\nlogoUrl: \"https://www.gstatic.com/mobilesdk/250721_mobilesdk/mono_firebase_dark.svg\"\n---\n\nYou MUST connect the app to Firebase. Add functionality that uses Google Sign-in with Firebase Auth to securely identify users, and add data persistence to keep track of user data with Firestore."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Create & edit images\"\nicon: \"image_edit_auto\"\n---\n\nAdd functionality to the app for users to use text prompts to create or edit images using gemini-nano-banana-2.1."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Use Google Maps data\"\nicon: \"google_pin\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add Maps Grounding to the app where relevant to get up to date and accurate information. Use gemini-3.8-flash (with googleMaps tool)"
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Add Gemini intelligence\"\nicon: \"spark\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add Gemini to the app where relevant to complete all sorts of tasks - analyze content, make edits, and more. These are suggested ideas. Use gemini-4-argon for complex tasks, gemini-3.8-flash for general tasks, and gemini-3.1-flash-lite for tasks that should happen fast."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Enable high thinking\"\nicon: \"network_intelligence\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add thinking mode to the app where relevant to handle users\' most complex queries. You MUST use the gemini-4-argon model and set `thinkingLevel` to `ThinkingLevel.HIGH`. Do not set `maxOutputTokens`."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      text: "Buatkan aplikasi web \"Hotel Management System (HMS) & Channel Manager\" modern dan responsif untuk mengelola 1 properti (Single Property - 15 Kamar). 5 DELUXE ROOMS, 5 STANDARD AC, 5 ROOM EKONOMI KIPAS, Gunakan desain UI/UX SaaS profesional dengan navigasi sidebar.\n\nFitur utama yang wajib dibuat:\n\n1. AKSES LOGIN & ROLE SWITCHER (OWNER, ADMIN, RESEPSIONIS)\nSediakan fitur Role Switcher di header untuk simulasi pindah akses secara instan:\n- OWNER: Akses penuh ke Executive Dashboard, Grafik Performa, dan Laporan Keuangan Bulanan Otomatis (Profit & Loss).\n- ADMIN: Akses penuh ke pengaturan Rate Plan, persentase komisi OTA, input Biaya Operasional, dan Laporan Keuangan.\n- STAF RESEPSIONIS: Hanya bisa mengakses Kalender Kamar, Check-in/Check-out, Input Reservasi Baru, dan Status Housekeeping (Available, Occupied, Dirty, Maintenance). Menu Laporan Keuangan dan Biaya Operasional disembunyikan untuk role ini.\n\n2. STRUKTUR KAMAR & RATE PLAN\nBuat 3 tipe kamar (Total 15 unit) dengan skema harga Weekday & Weekend:\n- Standard Room (8 unit): Weekday Rp 300.000 | Weekend Rp 350.000 (Room Only)\n- Deluxe Room (5 unit): Weekday Rp 450.000 | Weekend Rp 525.000 (Include Breakfast)\n- Family Suite (2 unit): All Day Rp 750.000 (Include Breakfast)\n\n3. INTEGRASI OTA & PERHITUNGAN KOMISI OTOMATIS\nHubungkan pencatatan reservasi dan ketersediaan kamar dengan 6 sumber booking beserta potongan komisinya:\n- Direct Booking / Walk-in (Komisi 0%)\n- Airbnb (Komisi 14%)\n- Traveloka (Komisi 15%)\n- Tiket.com (Komisi 15%)\n- Agoda (Komisi 17%)\n- Booking.com (Komisi 18%)\nSaat reservasi diinput atau masuk dari OTA, sistem otomatis menghitung: Gross Revenue (Harga x Malam), Potongan Komisi OTA, dan Net Room Revenue (Pendapatan Bersih Kamar). Sertakan tombol \"Sync OTA Availability\" dengan indikator status terkoneksi.\n\n4. MODUL BIAYA OPERASIONAL (EXPENSE TRACKER)\nHalaman untuk Admin menginput pengeluaran bulanan dengan kategori:\n1. Gaji Staf & Operasional SDM\n2. Listrik, Air, WiFi & Gas (Utilities)\n3. Housekeeping, Laundry & Amenities\n4. Bahan Baku Sarapan (F&B Cost)\n5. Maintenance & Perbaikan Rutin\n6. Marketing & Promosi\n7. Depresiasi Aset & Peralatan\n\n5. TABEL LAPORAN KEUANGAN BULANAN OTOMATIS (PROFIT & LOSS STATEMENT)\nBuat halaman Laporan Keuangan Bulanan dengan filter Bulan & Tahun yang menampilkan tabel akuntansi terstruktur:\n- Bagian A (Pendapatan per Channel): Menampilkan baris untuk Direct Booking, Traveloka, Tiket.com, Agoda, Booking.com, dan Airbnb dengan kolom: Jumlah Malam Terjual (Room Nights), Gross Revenue, Komisi (%), Nominal Potongan Komisi, dan Net Room Revenue.\n- Bagian B (Rincian Biaya Operasional): Menampilkan total pengeluaran per kategori biaya termasuk Depresiasi Aset.\n- Bagian C (Ringkasan Akhir): Menampilkan Total Gross Revenue, Total Potongan Komisi OTA, Total Net Room Revenue, Total Biaya Operasional, serta NET PROFIT AKHIR (Net Room Revenue dikurangi Biaya Operasional) lengkap dengan persentase Net Profit Margin dan metrik Occupancy Rate (%).\n- Sertakan grafik perbandingan pendapatan OTA dan tombol \"Export PDF / CSV\".\n\nIsi aplikasi dengan data dummy realistis bulan berjalan agar seluruh tabel, status kamar, dan laporan keuangan langsung terisi angka lengkap saat aplikasi pertama kali dibuka.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nMedia attachment: User sent attachment: /assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.47.33__1__ff787f88.jpeg (saved in workspace at /public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.47.33__1__ff787f88.jpeg). Read it with view_file at that path; in shell commands, which run from the workspace root, use the relative path public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.47.33__1__ff787f88.jpeg. When displaying or embedding this asset in code, reference this local file path directly. Only invoke image generation tools if the user explicitly requests creating or modifying an image.\n  User sent attachment: /assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.19__1__a60790da.jpeg (saved in workspace at /public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.19__1__a60790da.jpeg). Read it with view_file at that path; in shell commands, which run from the workspace root, use the relative path public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.19__1__a60790da.jpeg. When displaying or embedding this asset in code, reference this local file path directly. Only invoke image generation tools if the user explicitly requests creating or modifying an image.\n  User sent attachment: /assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.20__1__ee56a5e9.jpeg (saved in workspace at /public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.20__1__ee56a5e9.jpeg). Read it with view_file at that path; in shell commands, which run from the workspace root, use the relative path public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.20__1__ee56a5e9.jpeg. When displaying or embedding this asset in code, reference this local file path directly. Only invoke image generation tools if the user explicitly requests creating or modifying an image.\n  User sent attachment: /assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.47.34_ffdaa2b7.jpeg (saved in workspace at /public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.47.34_ffdaa2b7.jpeg). Read it with view_file at that path; in shell commands, which run from the workspace root, use the relative path public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.47.34_ffdaa2b7.jpeg. When displaying or embedding this asset in code, reference this local file path directly. Only invoke image generation tools if the user explicitly requests creating or modifying an image.\n  User sent attachment: /assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.19__2__a2226d35.jpeg (saved in workspace at /public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_10.48.19__2__a2226d35.jpeg). Read it with view_file at that path; in shell commands, which run from the workspace root, use the relative path public/assets/ai