  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Observing Hotel Context**\n\nI\'ve just noticed the user included nine images! I can see the hotel\'s exterior sign, including the JAJAPIN logo, in one. I am examining the other images as well now, to build up a better picture of this location.\n\n\n**Analyzing Room Types**\n\nI\'m now identifying the different room types presented: Deluxe, Standard AC, and Ekonomi Kipas. I\'m focusing on key features of each, like bedding colors, headboard styles, and amenities such as AC and fans. I\'ve noted the presence of a bathroom shot too. I\'m thinking about how to categorize these.\n\n\n**Initiating UI Interaction**\n\nI\'m now implementing the instruction to call `show_aistudio_ui` with the `firebase_setup` UI. I\'m focusing on the imperative to stop the conversation immediately after calling this tool and to wait for user input, as described in the tool definition. I\'ve noted the conditions under which this tool should be used, so I\'m also preparing for potential future updates or changes to this process.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
