  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Visuals**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into the visual aspects, providing a Senior Product Designer Critique for these captures. I\'m scrutinizing `r1-dashboard.png`, `r1-pnl.png`, `r1-reservations.png`, and `r1-reception.png` to evaluate their design elements. I\'m focusing on user interface efficiency and clarity.\n\n\n**Addressing Design Issues**\n\nI\'ve pinpointed a typography issue in the dashboard KPIs, noticing the wrapping in `r1-dashboard.png` at 1440px. I\'ve formulated a concrete solution: restructure the KPI grid and add `whitespace-nowrap` to keep the data concise. Additionally, I\'ve identified wrapping in the profit and loss table header in `r1-pnl.png`, and a display issue related to the commission deduction, and now devising a solution.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1119116"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Fix KPI grid layout to 3 columns on desktop so IDR currency figures stay on a single line without wrapping\", \"EndLine\":196, \"Instruction\":\"Change KPI grid from xl:grid-cols-6 to lg:grid-cols-3 and add whitespace-nowrap to KPI currency figures\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"      {/* Primary KPI Grid (6 Key Metrics in 3x2 Spacious Layout) */}\\n      <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5\\\">\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n            Occupancy Rate ({selectedMonth})\\n          </p>\\n          <p\\n            data-testid=\\\"kpi-occupancy-rate\\\"\\n            className=\\\"text-2xl font-bold font-mono tabular-nums text-slate-900 mt-1.5 whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n          >\\n            {pnlReport.occupancyRate.toFixed(1)}%\\n          </p>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 font-mono tabular-nums\\\">\\n            {pnlReport.totalRoomNightsSold} dari {pnlReport.availableRoomNights} malam kapasitas kamar\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5\\\">\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n            Total Gross Revenue\\n          </p>\\n          <p\\n            data-testid=\\\"kpi-gross-revenue\\\"\\n            className=\\\"text-2xl font-bold font-mono tabular-nums text-slate-900 mt-1.5 whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n          >\\n            {formatIDR(pnlReport.totalGrossRevenue)}\\n          </p>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 font-mono tabular-nums\\\">\\n            Average Daily Rate (ADR): {formatIDR(pnlReport.adr)}\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5\\\">\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n            Total Potongan Komisi OTA\\n          </p>\\n          <p\\n            data-testid=\\\"kpi-ota-commission\\\"\\n            className=\\\"text-2xl font-bold font-mono tabular-nums text-amber-700 mt-1.5 whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n          >\\n            -{formatIDR(pnlReport.totalCommissionAmount)}\\n          </p>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1\\\">\\n            Akumulasi potongan 6 sumber channel\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5\\\">\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n            Total Net Room Revenue\\n          </p>\\n          <p\\n            data-testid=\\\"kpi-net-room-revenue\\\"\\n            className=\\\"text-2xl font-bold font-mono tabular-nums text-slate-900 mt-1.5 whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n          >\\n            {formatIDR(pnlReport.totalNetRoomRevenue)}\\n          </p>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 font-mono tabular-nums\\\">\\n            RevPAR Bersih: {formatIDR(pnlReport.revPar)}\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5\\\">\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n            Total Biaya Operasional\\n          </p>\\n          <p\\n            data-testid=\\\"kpi-total-expenses\\\"\\n            className=\\\"text-2xl font-bold font-mono tabular-nums text-rose-700 mt-1.5 whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n          >\\n            {formatIDR(pnlReport.totalOperationalExpenses)}\\n          </p>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1\\\">\\n            7 Kategori Beban & Depresiasi Aset\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-slate-900 text-white border border-slate-900 rounded-xl p-5\\\">\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-300 whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n            NET PROFIT AKHIR ({selectedMonth})\\n          </p>\\n          <p\\n            data-testid=\\\"kpi-net-profit\\\"\\n            className=\\\"text-2xl font-bold font-mono tabular-nums text-emerald-400 mt-1.5 whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n          >\\n            {formatIDR(pnlReport.netProfit)}\\n          </p>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-300 mt-1 font-mono tabular-nums\\\">\\n            Net Profit Margin: {pnlReport.netProfitMargin.toFixed(1)}%\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\", \"StartLine\":116, \"TargetContent\":\"      {/* Primary KPI Grid (6 Key Metrics) */}\\n      <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-6 gap-4\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4\\\">\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500\\\">Occupancy Rate ({selectedMonth})</p>\\n          <p\\n            data-testid=\\\"kpi-occupancy-rate\\\"\\n            className=\\\"text-xl font-bold font-mono tabular-nums text-slate-900 mt-1\\\"\\n          >\\n            {pnlReport.occupancyRate.toFixed(1)}%\\n          </p>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 font-mono tabular-nums\\\">\\n            {pnlReport.totalRoomNightsSold} / {pnlReport.availableRoomNights} malam\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4\\\">\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500\\\">Total Gross Revenue</p>\\n          <p\\n            data-testid=\\\"kpi-gross-revenue\\\"\\n            className=\\\"text-xl font-bold font-mono tabular-nums text-slate-900 mt-1\\\"\\n          >\\n            {formatIDR(pnlReport.totalGrossRevenue)}\\n          </p>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 font-mono tabular-nums\\\">\\n            ADR: {formatIDR(pnlReport.adr)}\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4\\\">\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500\\\">Potongan Komisi OTA</p>\\n          <p\\n            data-testid=\\\"kpi-ota-commission\\\"\\n            className=\\\"text-xl font-bold font-mono tabular-nums text-amber-700 mt-1\\\"\\n          >\\n            -{formatIDR(pnlReport.totalCommissionAmount)}\\n          </p>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1\\\">\\n            6 Sumber Channel Aktif\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4\\\">\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500\\\">Net Room Revenue</p>\\n          <p\\n            data-testid=\\\"kpi-net-room-revenue\\\"\\n            className=\\\"text-xl font-bold font-mono tabular-nums text-slate-900 mt-1\\\"\\n          >\\n            {formatIDR(pnlReport.totalNetRoomRevenue)}\\n          </p>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 font-mono tabular-nums\\\">\\n            RevPAR: {formatIDR(pnlReport.revPar)}\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4\\\">\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500\\\">Total Biaya Operasional</p>\\n          <p\\n            data-testid=\\\"kpi-total-expenses\\\"\\n            className=\\\"text-xl font-bold font-mono tabular-nums text-rose-700 mt-1\\\"\\n          >\\n            {formatIDR(pnlReport.totalOperationalExpenses)}\\n          </p>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1\\\">\\n            7 Kategori Biaya & Depresiasi\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-slate-900 text-white border border-slate-900 rounded-xl p-4\\\">\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-300\\\">NET PROFIT AKHIR</p>\\n          <p\\n            data-testid=\\\"kpi-net-profit\\\"\\n            className=\\\"text-xl font-bold font-mono tabular-nums text-emerald-400 mt-1\\\"\\n          >\\n            {formatIDR(pnlReport.netProfit)}\\n          </p>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-300 mt-1 font-mono tabular-nums\\\">\\n            Margin: {pnlReport.netProfitMargin.toFixed(1)}%\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/ExecutiveDashboard.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Refining KPI grid layout in ExecutiveDashboard.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Refine KPI grid in ExecutiveDashboard.tsx\"}"
